orld house.    Serkan is back shoulder to shoulder with Eda, who he fears will lose, and Selin and ferit are working to prevent the duo from nesting; After he took refuge on the grounds that he had no confidence in Ferit, that he would pose a threat to the company and that he was not a suitable person, Serkan, who took not to say stop to someone who wants to go as a principle of life and did not have the courage to ask him to stay because he broke his heart too much in his time, is essentially the scene of storms breaking out in his inner world and entering into a deep sadness. Selin tells Serkan: 'If there is any hope that I can be with you, I will leave Ferit', and Eda hears. Eda is sure Serkan will say 'yes'. Serkan said Eda didn't want her. Eda decides to get away from Serkan as a moment and rebuild her life. She'll start applying for a scholarship again. Meanwhile, Ayfer learns of the contractual engagement between Serkan and Eda. She also knows that Eda is in love with Serkan. The situation in the florist is not going well, Ayfer is unable to pay her debts. Eda's last resort to get away from Serkan is to call her mother. After a while, Eda receives a call that she is on an Italian scholarship. Eda departs without telling Serkan. Serkan, on the other hand, is between his logic and his heart.","imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/274/686528.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":12,"title":"Aşktan Kopma","summary":null,"imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/275/689325.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":13,"title":"Nefes Nefese","summary":null,"imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/276/692211.jpg","imageSource":"tvmaze","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null},{"season":1,"episode":14,"title":"Unutmak Istiyorum","summary":null,"imageUrl":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/